    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="8" relname="span">I here what your saying P39.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="10" relname="span">Also, I agree that there should also be an option to reverse the correction</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="2" relname="circumstance">whenever the mouse is hovered over color-coded auto corrected words.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="9" relname="span">I also want to say thanks for providing the article that proposed guidelines for handling human errors,</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="volitional-cause">I needed to know more about that for my paper.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="9" relname="summary">Thanks again.</segment>
        <group id="7" type="span"/>
